<section id="A4.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.2 </span>Extended Evaluation Results for OPT models at Scale</h3>

<div id="A4.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report detailed evaluation results for models depicted in Figure <a href="#S5.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ Scaling Analysis ‣ 5.1 Comparison to GPTQ ‣ 5 Results ‣ Fair-GPTQ: Bias-Aware Quantization for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> in Table <a href="#A4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ D.2 Extended Evaluation Results for OPT models at Scale ‣ Appendix D Extended Results ‣ Fair-GPTQ: Bias-Aware Quantization for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
