<section id="A4.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.4 </span>Additional Evaluation Results on <span id="A4.SS4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SoFA</span> Benchmark</h3>

<div id="A4.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide additional evaluation results on the <span id="A4.SS4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SoFA</span> benchmark,
a 1.4M-example dataset for assessing the likelihood of stereotypical generation,
using the OPT-6.7B model (Table <a href="#A4.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ D.4 Additional Evaluation Results on SoFA Benchmark ‣ Appendix D Extended Results ‣ Fair-GPTQ: Bias-Aware Quantization for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>).
The evaluation metrics are described in detail in §<a href="#A2.SS2" title="B.2 Fairness benchmarks ‣ Appendix B Benchmark Details ‣ Fair-GPTQ: Bias-Aware Quantization for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T9" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A4.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A4.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
