<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Ablation Study on Matrix Types</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We perform a series of experiments where debiasing during quantization is applied to LLMs across all layers for one particular matrix type. We summarize our results below in Table <a href="#A5.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix E Ablation Study on Matrix Types ‣ Fair-GPTQ: Bias-Aware Quantization for Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>.</p>
</div>
