The <math id="A5.T10.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> value is fixed at 0.1 for all quantization modes.</figcaption>
